		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>50-foot-tall, steaming pile of intestines atop five crab legs.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 59, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 talon +7 (2d8) or boiling spray, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Boiling Spray</strong>. Double near- sized cube of searing fluids centered on Chavazvug, DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Horrific Appearance</strong>. Mortal creatures looking directly at Chavazvug, WIS 15+ or cursed to take double damage from fire. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources. Immune to fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Searing Flesh</strong>. Creatures touching or striking Chavazvug in melee take 1d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
